                      (    forth6809.asm):01666         ; own behavior for this case. ?DUP needs two tests, one per
                      (    forth6809.asm):01667         ; condition, since DUP-like and no-op are genuinely different
                      (    forth6809.asm):01668         ; code paths (QDUP branches on the popped value).
