                      (    forth6809.asm):02926         ; xt's slot effectively replaced by the throw code). Per CATCH's
                      (    forth6809.asm):02927         ; own spec, the i*x arguments' VALUES are explicitly unspecified
                      (    forth6809.asm):02928         ; after a catch, not just untested here - the final, unconditional
                      (    forth6809.asm):02929         ; stack restore discards them without needing to know how many
                      (    forth6809.asm):02930         ; there are.
