                      (    forth6809.asm):03745         ; xt's slot effectively replaced by the throw code). Per CATCH's
                      (    forth6809.asm):03746         ; own spec, the i*x arguments' VALUES are explicitly unspecified
                      (    forth6809.asm):03747         ; after a catch, not just untested here - the final, unconditional
                      (    forth6809.asm):03748         ; stack restore discards them without needing to know how many
                      (    forth6809.asm):03749         ; there are.
