                      (    forth6809.asm):07367         ; TSTUNLOOP - unit test for UNLOOP. A true no-op (bare RTS) per
                      (    forth6809.asm):07368         ; its own extensively-documented design history in the source -
                      (    forth6809.asm):07369         ; superseded by EXIT's own automatic frame-discarding, kept
                      (    forth6809.asm):07370         ; only for source compatibility. Not compile-time/immediate
                      (    forth6809.asm):07371         ; like the rest of this section - a plain runtime word, tested
                      (    forth6809.asm):07372         ; directly without the compile harness, same pattern as ALIGN's
                      (    forth6809.asm):07373         ; own test in section 3.6: pushes decoy values, calls UNLOOP,
                      (    forth6809.asm):07374         ; confirms the whole stack is genuinely undisturbed.
                      (    forth6809.asm):07375         ; ------------------------------------------------------------
