                      (    forth6809.asm):07583         ; TSTTHENZ - unit test for THEN, tag-mismatch case. Pushes a
                      (    forth6809.asm):07584         ; wrong value (0, matching none of TAGFWD/TAGBACK/TAGDO/TAGOF)
                      (    forth6809.asm):07585         ; in place of the expected TAGFWD, then calls THEN via CATCH.
                      (    forth6809.asm):07586         ; CFERR (confirmed by reading it directly) throws -22
                      (    forth6809.asm):07587         ; immediately without ever touching CODEHERE - the error path
