                      (    forth6809.asm):08847         ; that CATCH's own depth-restoration contract holds - same
                      (    forth6809.asm):08848         ; pattern as the divide-by-zero tests in earlier sections.
                      (    forth6809.asm):08849         ; ------------------------------------------------------------
