                      (    forth6809.asm):13755                                  ; PULU-then-compare fix elsewhere in this
                      (    forth6809.asm):13756                                  ; file), so BPL was testing whatever flags an
                      (    forth6809.asm):13757                                  ; unrelated, earlier instruction happened to
                      (    forth6809.asm):13758                                  ; leave set, not the sign of the value just
                      (    forth6809.asm):13759                                  ; popped. TSTA explicitly tests D's high byte
                      (    forth6809.asm):13760                                  ; (bit 7 of A reflects the full 16-bit value's
                      (    forth6809.asm):13761                                  ; sign) immediately before the branch that
