FF3A 3606             (    forth6809.asm):15842                    PSHU  D
FF3C 39               (    forth6809.asm):15843                    RTS
                      (    forth6809.asm):15844         
FF3D CC0000           (    forth6809.asm):15845         FALSEBODY: LDD   #$0000
FF40 3606             (    forth6809.asm):15846                    PSHU  D
FF42 39               (    forth6809.asm):15847                    RTS
                      (    forth6809.asm):15848         
